/*******************************************************************
 * File:        assemble_6502
 * Purpose:     Assembler backend for the 6502, 65C02 and 65C816
 *              instruction sets. Parses one tokenised BASIC source
 *              line at a time into machine code, using the callbacks
 *              in the assembly context to evaluate expressions and
 *              to assign labels.
 * Author:      Charles Ferguson (Gerph)
 ******************************************************************/

